   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"font-size:14px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:16px 20px;line-height:22.4px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">Hi, I am looking for a way to open multiple shiny app at the sime time. </span></code></pre><pre style=\"font-size:14px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:16px 20px;line-height:22.4px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">Suppose I have 2 shinyApps. I want that a user is able to open App2 while he is using App1 in another window </span></code><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0);font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;line-height:22.4px\">(how? with an URL link maybe?)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0);font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;line-height:22.4px\">, so that he is still able to continue to use App1.</span></pre><pre style=\"font-size:14px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:16px 20px;line-height:22.4px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0);font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;line-height:22.4px\">Is it possible? Does anyone know how to do it? Thank you!!!!</span></pre><pre style=\"font-size:14px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:16px 20px;line-height:22.4px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\">example of host shiny app </span></code></pre><pre style=\"font-size:14px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:16px 20px;line-height:22.4px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,0)\"># Define the location &#39;/&#39;</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">location</span> / {\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\">site_dir</span> /srv/shiny-server/\r\n}</code></pre><pre style=\"font-size:14px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:16px 20px;line-height:22.4px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace\">+---/srv/shiny-server\r\n|   +---shinyApp1\r\n|       +---server.R\r\n|       +---ui.R\r\n|   +---shinyApp2\r\n|       +---server.R\r\n|       +---ui.R\r\n|   +---assets\r\n|       +---style.css\r\n|       +---script.js</code></pre><pre style=\"font-size:14px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:16px 20px;line-height:22.4px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><br></pre></div>"
    ]
